<sheets>
<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="108.966" y="-144.272" size="3.81" layer="94" font="vector" ratio="10">ALAN - DURESS</text>
<text x="159.258" y="-142.24" size="2.54" layer="94" font="vector">author: Felix Rusu</text>
<text x="166.37" y="-11.43" size="1.778" layer="97">I2C</text>
<text x="151.13" y="-15.24" size="1.778" layer="97">SCL (Pin 4) = Serial Clock</text>
<text x="151.13" y="-17.78" size="1.778" layer="97">SDA (Pin 6) = Serial Data</text>
<text x="151.13" y="-20.32" size="1.778" layer="97">SD0 (Pin 7) = SA0/Address LSB</text>
<text x="151.13" y="3.81" size="1.778" layer="97">* CS needs to be set off board
to select SPI or I2C</text>
<text x="151.13" y="1.27" size="1.778" layer="97">CS High = I2C, Low = SPI</text>
<text x="151.13" y="-1.27" size="1.778" layer="97">Defaults to I2C as-is (R12)</text>
<text x="151.13" y="-27.94" size="1.778" layer="97">SDO pulled low by default (R13)
to set I2C address LSB to 0</text>
